# track-hover (M8): the pointer on P's track away from its thumb (150, 721): the thumb at 112 % and
# the value tip "x = 2.00" over it (ExtentSlider: .track:hover), P's row lit. Then P's x typed past
# the view's ends: 12 parks the thumb dashed on the track's right end with "x = 12.00 ▶", the tip
# clamped to the track's end (353.03..443), the ring the keyboard's after Enter; −14.2 parks it on
# the left with "◀ x = −14.20".
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 150 721
wait 500
shot hover
click 330 690
wait 16
type "12"
key Enter
wait 16
move 760 48
wait 500
shot parked-right
click 330 690
wait 16
type "-14.2"
key Enter
wait 16
shot parked-left
